{"team":"SEA","col":"#69BE28","identity":"balanced","funnel":"balanced-D","plays_pg":59.5,"adot":7.5,"report_html":"<div class=\"report\"><h2>No Fixed Address</h2><p>There's no bell-cow to bank on \u2014 the lead back sees just <strong>50%</strong> of carries (league ~59%), a committee that caps any one back's ceiling and makes their rushing props matchup- and script-dependent.</p><h3>The Offensive Blueprint</h3><p>In the passing game the ball funnels to <strong>Jaxon Smith-Njigba</strong> \u2014 <strong>29% of targets</strong> (league ~23%), a genuine alpha share that concentrates the receiving value at the top.</p><p>The WR2 is unusually involved here \u2014 <strong>18%</strong> of targets (league ~15%), meaning there's bankable volume beyond the top receiver.</p><p>They're a heavy under-center team (61% shotgun vs ~68%) \u2014 a pro-style, run-committed structure.</p><p>When they fall behind they abandon the run entirely \u2014 59% pass while trailing, so their pass-catchers have huge comeback-script ceilings.</p><h3>In the Red Zone</h3><p>Their red-zone identity is <strong>run-first</strong> (47% pass), funnelling touchdown equity to <strong>Jadarian Price</strong>.</p><h2>Defense \u2014 No Obvious Seam</h2><p>They lock down opposing WR1s \u2014 just 48 rec yds/game (vs ~58); fade receiving props there.</p><p><strong>Soft against opposing tight ends</strong> \u2014 42 rec yds/game (vs ~35). A rec-yards target.</p><p>They surrender <strong>106 rushing</strong> and <strong>226 passing</strong> yards per game (league ~120 / ~230). No dominant funnel \u2014 read it matchup by matchup.</p><p>A stingy, efficient defense \u2014 just 42% success allowed (vs ~44%); temper expectations for opposing skill players.</p><h2>The Betting Angles</h2><p>Bottom line: their pass-catchers have massive ceilings in comeback scripts (fade-material as underdogs).</p><p><em>Built on 2024\u201325 data; the profile rebuilds through the season as the current staff and roster set their own tendencies.</em></p></div>","depth":{"QB":[{"name":"Sam Darnold","slot":"QB1","starter":true,"td":9,"props":{"Comp":19.01,"Att":29.57,"Pass Yds":224.15,"Pass TD":1.42,"INT":0.64,"Rush Yds":8.15},"d":{"completions":19.01,"attempts":29.57,"pass_yards":224.15,"pass_td":1.42,"interceptions":0.64,"rush_att":2.28,"rush_yards":8.15}}],"RB":[{"name":"Jadarian Price","slot":"RB1","starter":true,"td":26,"props":{"Rush Att":12.19,"Rush Yds":52.08,"Tgt":2.29,"Rec":1.8,"Rec Yds":13.22},"d":{"rush_att":12.19,"rush_yards":52.08,"targets":2.29,"receptions":1.8,"rec_yards":13.22,"rec_td":0.06}},{"name":"George Holani","slot":"RB2","starter":true,"td":14,"props":{"Rush Att":3.05,"Rush Yds":10.77,"Tgt":1.83,"Rec":1.26,"Rec Yds":8.87},"d":{"rush_att":3.05,"rush_yards":10.77,"targets":1.83,"receptions":1.26,"rec_yards":8.87,"rec_td":0.05}},{"name":"Emanuel Wilson","slot":"RB3","starter":false,"td":21,"props":{"Rush Att":5.71,"Rush Yds":25.15,"Tgt":1.83,"Rec":1.27,"Rec Yds":8.13},"d":{"rush_att":5.71,"rush_yards":25.15,"targets":1.83,"receptions":1.27,"rec_yards":8.13,"rec_td":0.06}},{"name":"Velus Jones Jr.","slot":"RB4","starter":false,"td":13,"props":{"Rush Att":3.27,"Rush Yds":18.21,"Tgt":1.37,"Rec":0.82,"Rec Yds":7.09},"d":{"rush_att":3.27,"rush_yards":18.21,"targets":1.37,"receptions":0.82,"rec_yards":7.09,"rec_td":0.03}}],"WR":[{"name":"Jaxon Smith-Njigba","slot":"WR1","starter":true,"td":34,"props":{"Tgt":9.02,"Rec":6.5,"Rec Yds":81.11,"Rec TD":0.42},"d":{"targets":9.02,"receptions":6.5,"rec_yards":81.11,"rec_td":0.42}},{"name":"Rashid Shaheed","slot":"WR2","starter":true,"td":13,"props":{"Tgt":3.2,"Rec":2.02,"Rec Yds":29.17,"Rec TD":0.14},"d":{"targets":3.2,"receptions":2.02,"rec_yards":29.17,"rec_td":0.14}},{"name":"Cooper Kupp","slot":"WR3","starter":true,"td":29,"props":{"Tgt":6.0,"Rec":4.28,"Rec Yds":52.72,"Rec TD":0.34},"d":{"targets":6.0,"receptions":4.28,"rec_yards":52.72,"rec_td":0.34}},{"name":"Tory Horton","slot":"WR4","starter":false,"td":21,"props":{"Tgt":3.02,"Rec":1